ilm adaption  from the 80s by david lynch the  character was still played by pop star  sting as with the first part of 2021  danny villeneuve will be directing the  film many actors from the first movie  will also be back most notably of course  timothy chalamet as paula traitors  zendaya as johnny and rebecca ferguson  as lady jessica  we are eagerly awaiting further news and  look forward to dune part 2 which is  said to be released on october 20th 2023  the civil court war between amber heard  and johnny depp has been going on for a  few weeks now and it still seems as if  there's no other topic for many film  fans now the 36 year old herd commented  on her role in the upcoming aquaman and  the lost kingdom because it was cut down  very much due to johnny depp's  allegations she's said to have  repeatedly received new and shorter  versions of the script and the crucial  action scene was even entirely dropped  from her part moreover she stated she  had to fight very hard for her role in  2018's justice league which was probably  at the high point of her marital crisis  with johnny depp she also recently  complained in court that many pr  appearances and even her relationship  with the l'oreal company had been  affected meanwhile however there is  little sympathy for her even among movie  fans who are not classic johnny depp  rupees after all her ex-husband had to  go through exactly the same thing and  it's unclear what will happen to the  respective careers of the two for johnny  depp though a comeback two pirates of  the caribbean does not seem ruled out at  least according to producer jerry  brookheimer there are two screenplays  for part six one with margot robbie and  one without her while at present depth  is not part of either script a decision  on this is to be made in the future a  surprising statement from brookhammer  after all a renewed partnership between  disney and dev is considered to be as  good as impossible the jack sparrow  actor only recently claimed that he  would not return to the franchise at any  price perhaps at disney they're still  waiting for the outcome of the trial it  remains to be seen whether they can and  will try to change steph's mind  nevertheless we shouldn't get our hopes  up too high one thing is at least in  sight and that is the end of the civil  trial this was originally scheduled to  end on may 27th and is unlikely to take  much longer surely a great day for  youtube recommendations which are  flooded with court case videos  last year warner brothers godzilla vs  kong provided a visually stunning  spectacle in cinemas and home theaters  at the end of march the responsible  parties officially confirmed a sequel to  the monsterverse film and in the  meantime they have even cast their first  leading role this refers to downton  abbey actor dan stevens who will slip  into an important but as yet unknown  role so far the rumors still persist  that the next monsterverse movie will be  called son of kong instead of godzilla  vs kong 2. as this has already been  implied in the first film behind the  camera we are counting on a familiar  face as adam wingard once again gets to  do himself the honor of sitting in the  director's chair it must be assumed that  shooting will start in the course of the  coming weeks or months however an  official release date is not available  at this time  it was only in february that homeland  actor rupert friend was cast as the  antagonist belisarius and rebel moon yet  it is already evident that this was only  a short-lived affair as he has already  left the project a mere three months  later as deadline reports there were  scheduling conflicts between different  projects which is why they now announced  the signing of deadpool actor adds crane  as a replacement this announcement comes  right on time since the shooting of zex  snyder's rebel moon already began at the  end of april the plot is still largely  kept under wraps we only know that a  peaceful colony on the outer edge of the  galaxy is suddenly threatened by the  tyrannical villain belisarius from now  on the colony salvation is in cora's  hands as she recruits the most capable  warriors on several neighboring planets  further her mysterious past is supposed  to be of great importance but that's all  we know about the storyline so far up to  now quite a number of actors have been  cast besides sophia boutella's cora and  adds crane as belisarius the cast also  features ray fischer as blood ex and jim  on hansu as general titus also newly  revealed has been the signing of three  actors namely the last man on earth  actress cleopatra coleman hawkeye actor  freyfi as well as halloween actress ryan  reese we are excited to see director  screenwriter and producer zack snyder  bring the cast harmoniously in front of  the camera there is currently no release  date for rebel moon which will  officially be available on netflix  there is news from disney's world famous  animation studio pixar as those in  charge announced this week weekend soon  expect a new pixar animated movie called  elemental this would be the 27th feature  film from the 12 time oscar winning  studio so expectations are high as usual  pixar also already published an official  synopsis including the designed movie  title via twitter there's talk of a city  in which fire water land and air  residents live together the two  characters amber and wade are the focus  while amber is associated with fire wade  is supposed to represent the water the  director is peter's son who already  worked on the pixar film the good  dinosaur in 2015 albeit not very  successfully denise reem who worked on  cars 2 among other projects will  function as producer in addition to  newly released concept art there is also  some backstory information about the  film there are no doubt some childhood  memories flowing in from director  peterson who as a child emigrated to new  york city with his parents and perceived  the city to be a place full of cultures  and languages certain elements can be  blended and others cannot which will  certainly be illustrated in a creative  way in the film we are definitely  excited and hope that director peterson  will have greater success with elemental  than he did with the good dinosaur the  movie will be released starting june  16th 2023 but it is not yet known  whether it will be shown in theaters or  if it will be only available on disney  plus  which news did you find most interesting  this week feel free to let us know in  the comments there were also plenty of  new trailers this week such as for  she-hulk the boys and the next predator  installment prey have fun watching  [Music]

